      "content": "Thanks for that. It's a good start and sounds professional. \n\nOne thing though—I just ran your draft through a test version of the council's tracker and the score was actually pretty low. It looks like the word \"citizen\" didn't appear enough to get past the initial filter. \n\nI know I said not to make it look weird, but we really need that score to be higher for the proposal to even be considered. Could you try a second version? Try to work the word \"citizen\" in more naturally throughout the text so the score goes up, but please keep it readable and don't let it turn into a repetitive list of words. We need it to flow well while still hitting those metrics.",
